[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0010","text":"凛世，怎么了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0020","text":"——那个……Producer大人的……\n手……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0030","text":"手？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0040","text":"为了塑造角色……\n我一直在……观摩您的打字……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0050","text":"啊，这样啊\n这次拍的剧里要用电脑嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0060","text":"是的……\n凛世是……大家的后方支援……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0070","text":"是在暗中获取情报、\n支援同伴的幕后功臣角色呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0080","text":"Producer大人的打字方式……\n我想学习一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0090","text":"哈哈，如果我能派上用场的话尽管看\n再靠近一点也没关系哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0100","text":"不、不用了……\n从这里就好……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
